      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMANCHE RICK (1) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 5 lengths at this track in a handy 22.68 beating Duran Sting. The form from his last run stacks up well. Looks the one to beat. FAWN RUPEE (2) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 9 length 5th at this track (23.42). Boasts a strong record from this draw with five wins and two minor placings from 10 starts. Worth another chance. HELLO NEMO (8) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Ramset Ready (22.93) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Will give a great sight again. FRANKLY (3) has strong credentials at this circuit over this journey.",
